 "sentences": [
  "There was a spring of light at the foot of a hill.",
  "A clay jar glowed beside it.",
  "A smooth hollow lay open in the rock.",
  "A spiral shell lay on the slope.",
  "A boulder sat on the slope.",
  "Ada wanted to send a boat into the sky.",
  "She pushed the hollow hard, but it did not move.",
  "She gave the boulder a hard push, and it split apart.",
  "A little carved boat lay among the pieces.",
  "A heap of pebbles lay on the ground.",
  "Ada felt sad about the boulder.",
  "She was delighted with the carved boat.",
  "She shook the jar, and it went dark.",
  "She was delighted with the jar.",
  "She dipped the jar into the spring, and it began to glow.",
  "She touched the hollow, but it would not move.",
  "She grew frustrated with the hollow.",
  "She moved the carved boat, and it settled into the hollow.",
  "She pushed the hollow hard.",
  "A small skiff took shape beside the hollow.",
  "Ada realized that the hollow made a boat only when the carved boat lay in it.",
  "She pressed on the hollow, but it did not budge.",
  "In time, she stopped thinking about the boulder.",
  "She moved the carved boat, and it came out of the hollow.",
  "She moved the shell, and it settled into the hollow.",
  "She was delighted with the shell.",
  "She moved the shell, and it came out of the hollow.",
  "She wondered what came with the shell.",
  "She moved the shell again, and it settled into the hollow.",
  "She grew frustrated with the hollow again.",
  "She moved the shell, and it came out of the hollow.",
  "She moved the shell again, and it settled into the hollow.",
  "She touched the hollow.",
  "A shell-shaped cup took shape beside the hollow.",
  "Ada realized that the hollow made a cup only when the shell lay in it.",
  "She moved the shell, and it came out of the hollow.",
  "She shoved the skiff, and it rose into the air and came down on the far hill.",
  "The carved boat settled into the hollow.",
  "Ada laughed with joy."
 ],
